# NOTE: Do NOT exclude ingest/ — retrieval/crag.py imports
# ingest.vector_store and ingest.reranker at runtime. Excluding the
# whole directory broke retrieval on Render (CRAG returned FAILED).
# The actual one-time ingest scripts (parse_pdf.py, late_chunker.py,
# run_ingest_pipeline.py, run_metadata_pipeline.py, add_*.py,
# metadata_builder.py) ship in the image but are simply never invoked.
# If image size becomes a concern, exclude those individual files only.

